   "docstring": "# Step-2 Quantitative Fourier Stability\n\nThis file proves the quantitative approximation bound for Step 2 of the\ncontrolled modular-multiplication construction. It first analyzes one retained\nQPE label, then controls coherent superpositions by decomposing them into\northogonal work-label fibers.\n\nThe proof has four main layers:\n\n* establish register disjointness, freshness, and packet expansions;\n* compare the actual and ideal Fourier packets for one good label;\n* prove contraction for a coherent packet with a fixed work label; and\n* reassemble orthogonal work fibers into the final uniform Step-2 estimate.",
